'''Lantern''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 14th tier in the Team Rewards during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is black with a slight yellow haze with three yellow jack-o-lantern faces. The guard is golden, and the handle is solid black.
